# fu143-goal-child-closeout — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml; per-row intent
# below). Columns: id | world | patch | env | expect
# in-progress        = baseline: in-progress child, merged strong link, no open PR → closeout
# strong-goal        = an open PR on the goal base STRONGLY links it → HELD (live work)
# bare-goal          = an open PR on the goal base only MENTIONS it → closeout (defect 1)
# strong-master      = an open PR on MASTER strongly links it → closeout (base scope, defect 1)
# cross-repo         = an open PR carries the cross-repo spelling `homelab#100` → closeout (defect 1)
# blocked-resolved   = agent/blocked child, blocked-on resolved → closeout (defect 2)
# blocked-unresolved = agent/blocked child, blocked-on unresolved → HELD (defect 2)
# blocked-no-marker  = agent/blocked child whose merged PR carries NO blocked-on: marker (its own
#                      closeout parked it — the oracle-fleet#798 shape, FU-290) → HELD, never
#                      read as "clear" (a level-triggered closeout loop otherwise)
# review-no-fix      = homelab#2164: agent/review child with NO agent-fix, merged strong link,
#                      no open PR → closeout (the widened goalcand selector finds it)
# beyond-window      = homelab#3309: the strong-linked PR merged into the goal base is OLDER (by
#                      creation) than the 41 newest merged PRs of the repo → still closeout: the
#                      merged read is scoped to the goal base, never the repo-wide newest 40
# own-branch-unlinked= the child's OWN branch merged into the base without citing it → HELD and
#                      REPORTED (finished work, close by hand), never silent
# full-page          = the base has a full page (100) of merged PRs and none links the child →
#                      REPORTED as an incomplete window, never silent
# mention-beyond-window = a goal-base merged PR only MENTIONS the child (a sibling seam) and is
#                      older than the repo's newest 40 → reported HELD and recorded in GOALHELD,
#                      so the agent/review phantom belt cannot re-queue it (#3770 review)
in-progress        |  |  |  | in-progress
strong-goal        |  |  |  | strong-goal
bare-goal          |  |  |  | bare-goal
strong-master      |  |  |  | strong-master
cross-repo         |  |  |  | cross-repo
blocked-resolved   |  |  |  | blocked-resolved
blocked-unresolved |  |  |  | blocked-unresolved
blocked-no-marker  |  |  |  | blocked-no-marker
review-no-fix      |  |  |  | review-no-fix
beyond-window      |  |  |  | beyond-window
own-branch-unlinked|  |  |  | own-branch-unlinked
full-page          |  |  |  | full-page
mention-beyond-window|  |  |  | mention-beyond-window
